// t2r-engine-symbols.def - the canonical engine-symbol contract (single source of truth).
//
// X(<kind>, <name>, <legacy_va>)   kind: F = function, V = data/global, C = code site
//
// Included by both the extension (tools/ext/t2r-engine.h) and the mod
// (mod/src/loader/ext-symbols.cpp).  <name> is the published id; both sides hash
// the SAME token with FNV-1a 64 (SID), so the strings can never drift apart.
// <legacy_va> is the address in the reference winmm build (image base 0x180000000);
// it is the fallback when a rebuilt winmm does not publish the symbol by name.

